             CHECKLIST
             ================================================= -->

        <div class="article-callout">

          <h2>
            Quick checklist for parents
          </h2>


          <p>

            Before choosing a tutor, consider these questions:

          </p>


          <ul>

            <li>
              Does the tutor understand my child's class and subject?
            </li>

            <li>
              Does the tutor have relevant academic knowledge?
            </li>

            <li>
              Does the teaching approach suit my child's needs?
            </li>

            <li>
              Can the tutor explain difficult concepts clearly?
            </li>

            <li>
              Are the proposed timings practical?
            </li>

            <li>
              Is there a clear way to discuss progress?
            </li>

            <li>
              Does the tutor make realistic rather than exaggerated
              promises?
            </li>

          </ul>

        </div>



